
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>NOVYX Pay</title>
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      background: #080b18;
      color: white;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 24px;
    }
    main { max-width: 520px; }
    h1 { font-size: 42px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
    h1 span { color: #00e5ff; }
    p { color: #aab3ca; line-height: 1.7; }
    .status {
      display: inline-block;
      border: 1px solid #263b56;
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 8px 14px;
      color: #00e5ff;
      margin-top: 12px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main>
    <h1>NOVYX <span>Pay</span></h1>
    <p>A new way to experience digital payments.</p>
    <div class="status">Development preview</div>
    <p>Secure payment features are not yet enabled.</p>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
